This chart is a modified version of the Stan's Robot Shop Helm chart
(https://github.com/instana/robot-shop), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications by Md Sanowar Hossain (2026):
- Chart converted to apiVersion v2 and image tag pinned to 2.1.0
- PodSecurityPolicy, ClusterRole, ClusterRoleBinding and ServiceAccount templates removed (PSP removed in Kubernetes 1.25)
- web Service changed to ClusterIP; ALB Ingress template added (ingressClassName: alb)
- Redis StorageClass and image made configurable (was hard-coded to gp2)
- NET_ADMIN capability removed from the MySQL container
- OpenShift and NodePort options removed
